### 1. Get Video Metadata
GET http://localhost:5000/api/video/metadata/eio1ezE80Gc
Accept: application/json

### 2. Download audio
HEAD http://localhost:5000/api/video/download?id=eio1ezE80Gc&formatId=18&ext=mp4&title=My_Video_Choice
Accept: */*

### 3. Download video 480p
# Pass both your 480p formatId and the audio track formatId simultaneously
HEAD http://localhost:5000/api/video/download?id=eio1ezE80Gc&formatId=480&ext=mp4&title=My_Converted_Song
Accept: */*

### 4. Search for videos
GET http://localhost:5000/api/video/search?q=cats
Accept: application/json